%D1%8C_-_SVM_-_Security_and_Vulnerability_Management_-_%D0%A3%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5_%D1%83%D1%8F%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8F%D0%BC%D0%B8_-_%D0%A1%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BC%D1%8B_%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B0_%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%89%D0%B8%D1%89%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8_%D0%B8_%D1%83%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F_%D1%83%D1%8F%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8F%D0%BC%D0%B8_-_ASV_-_Approved_Scanning_Vendor_-_%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5_%D1%83%D1%8F%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B9_-_%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%8B_%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8\">сканер уязвимостей</a> нового поколения для малого и <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A1%D0%9C%D0%91_-_%D0%A1%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%B8_%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%B1%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%81_-_SME_-_Small_and_medium-sized_enterprises_-_SMB_-_Small-medium_business_-_SOHO_-_Small_Office_Home_Office\">среднего бизнеса</a>. Он обнаруживает недостатки безопасности во всех популярных <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%9E%D0%A1_-_%D0%9E%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B0_-_OS_-_Operating_system_-_%D0%9E%D0%B1%D1%89%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B5_%D0%9F%D0%9E\">ОС</a>, в том числе <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%98%D0%BC%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%89%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5_-_%D0%98%D0%BC%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_-_%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%85%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D1%86%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B9_%D1%81%D1%83%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%82_-_%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B6%D0%B8%D0%BC_%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%85_%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA_%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%85_%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%88%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%B8_%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%85%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B8%D0%B9\">отечественных</a>, и в распространенном ПО. Сканирование может выполняться в двух режимах: в режиме <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A7%D1%91%D1%80%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%8F%D1%89%D0%B8%D0%BA_-_%D0%9C%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B4_%D1%87%D1%91%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D1%8F%D1%89%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0\">черного ящика</a> (<a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%9A%D0%B8%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_-_Red_Teaming_-_Red_Team_-_%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B7_%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%89%D0%B8%D1%89%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8_%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5_%D0%BD%D0%B0_%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5_-_%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D1%8F_%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BC%D1%83%D0%BB%D1%8F%D1%86%D0%B8%D1%8F_%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BA_-_pentesting_-_%D0%BF%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B3_-_%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%85%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B3_-_%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8B%D0%B5_%D1%85%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%8B_-_%D1%8D%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%85%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B3_-_%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D1%88%D0%BB%D1%8F%D0%BF%D0%B0_-_white_hat_-_Penetration_Testing_-\">пентест</a>) и <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%9A%D0%B8%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_-_SAST_-_Static_Application_Security_Testing_-_DevSecTestOps_-_%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5_%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D1%8F%D1%89%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0_-_%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%BA_%D1%83%D1%8F%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B9_%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8_%D0%B2_%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%85%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%BC_%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B5_%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F_%D0%BD%D0%B0_%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%85_%D1%8D%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%85_%D0%B6%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%BB%D0%B0_%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B7%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BA%D0%B8_%D0%9F%D0%9E\">белого ящика</a> (аудит). Сканер нового поколения включает базу уязвимостей, основанную на сведениях из <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A4%D0%A1%D0%A2%D0%AD%D0%9A_%D0%A0%D0%A4_%D0%91%D0%94%D0%A3_-_%D0%91%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BA_%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%85_%D1%83%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B7_%D0%A4%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B9_%D1%81%D0%BB%D1%83%D0%B6%D0%B1%D1%8B_%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%85%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%BE-%D1%8D%D0%BA%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8F\">БДУ ФСТЭК</a>, CVE, <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/OWASP_-_Open_Web_Application_Security_Project\">OWASP Top</a> 101, а также из собственной базы Positive Technologies. XSpider PRO адаптирован для работы в <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A0%D1%83%D1%81%D0%91%D0%98%D0%A2%D0%B5%D1%85_-_Astra_Linux_-_%D0%93%D0%9A_%D0%90%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0_-_%D0%93%D1%80%D1%83%D0%BF%D0%BF%D0%B0_%D0%90%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0\">Astra Linux</a>, что является одним из главных запросов организаций, ограниченных в использовании зарубежного ПО.</p>\n<p>«<a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A4%D0%A1%D0%A2%D0%AD%D0%9A_%D0%A0%D0%A4_%D0%9D%D0%94%D0%92_-_%D1%81%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%84%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%82_%D1%81%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2_%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%89%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8B_%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%84%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%B8_%D0%BF%D0%BE_%D1%83%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BD%D1%8E_%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8F_%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%81%D1%83%D1%82%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%8F_%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BA%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%85_%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B9_-_%D0%A4%D0%A1%D0%A2%D0%AD%D0%9A_%D0%A0%D0%A4_%D0%A1%D0%97%D0%98_-_%D0%93%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80_%D1%81%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%84%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%85_%D1%81%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2_%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%89%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8B_%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%84%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%B8\">Сертификация ФСТЭК</a> позволила сделать XSpider PRO доступным еще одному сегменту — тем, кто обязан поддерживать киберустойчивость исключительно при помощи сертифицированных <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A0%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%8F_-_%D0%A0%D0%A4_-_%D0%A0%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%B9%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D1%84%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D1%8F\">российских</a> средств защиты и соблюдать нормативные требования. Сканер уязвимостей нового поколения, сочетающий экспертизу Positive Technologies в выявлении <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/MITRE_CVE_-_MITRE_Common_Vulnerabilities_and_Exposures_-_%D0%91%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B0_%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%85_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%89%D0%B5%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%85_%D1%83%D1%8F%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B9_%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%84%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B9_%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8\">уязвимостей</a> с простотой установки и эксплуатации, полезен в государственных и критически значимых инфраструктурах. Продукт подходит организациям с любым бюджетом, а также компаниям с начальным уровнем зрелости <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%9A%D0%B8%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_-_%D0%9A%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BF%D1%8C%D1%8E%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_-_%D0%98%D0%BD%D1%84%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_-_%D0%98%D0%91-%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80_-_%D0%9A%D0%B8%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D1%83%D0%BF%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_-_Cybersecurity_-_%D0%9A%D0%B8%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%82%D1%8B_-_%D0%9A%D0%B8%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%83%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B9%D1%87%D0%B8%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_-_Cyber_resilience\">ИБ</a>, независимо от их размера и сферы деятельности», — сказала<b> <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A8%D0%B8%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%BD_%D0%92%D0%B8%D0%BA%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80\">Виктория Шишкина</a></b>, руководитель продуктов <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/Positive_Technologies_-_PT_SIEM_-_MP_SIEM_-_MaxPatrol_SIEM_-_MaxPatrol_Security_Information_and_Event_Management_-_MaxPatrol_EDR\">MaxPatrol VM</a> и XSpider PRO, Positive Technologies. </p>\n        \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n    \n    \n    \n            <ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://market.cnews.ru/?service_id=4&amp;p=undertext\">В каком ЦОД разместить оборудование Colocation? Найти ответ на ИТ-маркетплейсе CNewsMarket</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n    \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n\n\n    \n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><h2>Другие материалы рубрики</h2>\n\t\t<p></p>\n\t\t\n\t\n\n<!-- конференции -->\n    \n\n<!-- /конференции -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","contentTruncated":false}
